  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Family Undead</strong></p><p><strong>Anima Weapon </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.OMniYOAfN6dur4hv]{Anima Weapon: Tear Flesh}</p><p><strong>Anima Morph </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.ouhFpLdtIeCk7QzA]{Anima Morph: Tear Flesh}</p><p><strong>Anima Ability</strong> @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.PjcZS9PrDU0Vrdce]{Anima Ability: Tear Flesh}</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You go for a sharp bite that tears through flesh. Make an anima strike. On a hit, you inflict 1d6 persistent bleed damage.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (4th) </strong>The persistent damage increases to 2d6.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (6th) </strong>If you critically hit with your strike, the DC to end the persistent bleed damage increases to 20 (15 with particularly effective assistance).</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (7th) </strong>The persistent damage increases to 3d6.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (9th) </strong>The persistent damage increases to 4d6.</p>"
